  "description": "Embed the API Test Spark React SPA into any .NET 10 Minimal API project with a\n      single MapApiTestSpark() call. Autodiscovers OpenAPI v3 endpoints and renders an interactive\n      test harness at /api-test-spark/. Features: collapsible accordion endpoint groups, Remote API\n      Explorer (browse and test multiple named remote REST APIs via server-side profile proxies that keep\n      server credentials off the browser network tab), browser-manageable remote profiles, full response code documentation with expandable schemas, operationId\n      display, schema constraint and default-value surfacing, full markdown rendering of OpenAPI\n      descriptions, sortable response tables, editable object forms, curl command generation, API Doc\n      Builder, draggable debug panel, and Azure Application Insights integration. Zero configuration\n      required — just add MapApiTestSpark().",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
