  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.4.0 — New: Remote API Profiles — configure multiple named remote APIs\n      in Program.cs or from the browser Config page. Each profile has its own explorer and doc builder route,\n      name, description, base URL, OpenAPI URL, credentials, and headers. Server profile secrets are redacted\n      from config and used only by the server-side profile proxy; browser-created profiles stay local and fetch\n      OpenAPI documents directly. Duplicate profile names are blocked before save. Legacy single-remote\n      options remain supported as an additive compatibility seed. See CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
